  "steps": [
    "Heat butter in a pan and add cumin seeds, bay leaf, ginger, and garlic. Sauté until fragrant.",
    "Add the crumbled tempeh and cook for a couple of minutes, then add the onions and cook until they turn nicely brown.",
    "Add the tomato puree along with turmeric, Kashmiri red chilli powder, pav bhaji masala, cumin powder, coriander powder, garam masala, and salt. Cook until the masala is rich and well reduced.",
    "Add the pumpkin, capsicum, carrots, and beetroot. Add enough water, cover, and cook until the vegetables become completely soft.",
    "Mash everything well until you get that classic pav bhaji texture. Let it simmer for a few more minutes so all those flavours come together.",
    "Serve hot with toasted pav, bread, or enjoy it as a protein-rich bhaji bowl."
  ],
